      <!-- SECTION 1: THE MANIFESTO -->
      <section id="manifesto" class="xp-section-anchor">
        <div class="manifesto-box">
          <div class="manifesto-tagline-bar">
            <span class="section-tag manifesto-tag">OUR PHILOSOPHY</span>
            <span class="manifesto-comment">// WHY WE BUILT THIS</span>
          </div>
          
          <h2 class="manifesto-title">
            Making FinDom &amp; Submissive Culture Fun Again
          </h2>
          
          <p class="manifesto-quote">
            "FinDom should not be a static transactional tip jar. It should be an exhilarating game of status, devotion, luxury roleplay, and collective celebration."
          </p>

          <div class="manifesto-grid">
            <div>
              <p>
                For years, Second Life FinDom has too often felt one-dimensional—silent tip jars and transactional scripts with no world to explore. Control &amp; Chaos was engineered from the ground up to revolutionize that experience.
              </p>
              <p>
                Our custom LSL Experience Cloud turns every interaction on the sim—from lively conversations in the Grand Ballroom to laser arena defense, arcade puzzle merge games, and sim-wide coin hunts—into tangible XP and Gold Coins.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p>
                Whether you are a Dominant looking to command devotion and build a loyal faction, or a Submissive striving to earn prestigious vanity titles and unlock exclusive privileges, Control &amp; Chaos is your living playground.
              </p>
              <p>
                Active play always triumphs over static bots. Every tribute, game, and conversation leaves a mark on the estate leaderboard.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

