        <div class="earn-grid">
          
          <!-- 1. Chat & RP -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">💬 +2 to +4 XP per 90s</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Roleplay &amp; Conversation</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Simply talking in local chat (3+ words, 15+ characters) awards <strong>+2 XP</strong>. Writing descriptive <code>/me</code> roleplay emotes awards <strong>+4 XP</strong>. Protected by a 90-second conversational cooldown.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. Social Sit Radar -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🛋️ +2 to +3 XP / 3–5 min</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Social Sit Radar</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Earn passive XP while lounging in the Grand Ballroom, Bar, or Lounge. Solo sitting awards <strong>+2 XP every 3 minutes</strong>. Coupled sitting with a partner awards <strong>+3 XP every 5 minutes</strong> (250 XP/day cap).
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. Daily Quests -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🎯 +25 XP • +10 Coins</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Rotating Daily Quests</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Two fresh missions reset daily at midnight SLT at the main Terminal. Quests rotate through chat sessions, sitting, trivia answers, game rounds, and coin hunts for fast coin stacking.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. Trivia Battles -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">❓ +15 to +25 XP</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Live DOM vs SUB Trivia</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Sim staff launch live trivia rounds in local chat. First correct answer earns <strong>+15 XP</strong>, with <strong>+25 XP bonus twist rounds</strong>. Trivia scores are tallied by faction to crown the weekly winning team!
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 5. Greedy Dice -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🎲 +25 XP • Gold Coins</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Greedy Dice Arcade</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              The beloved Second Life Greedy dice game is fully integrated into the sim reward system. Joining a game grants <strong>+5 XP</strong>, winning rounds awards coins, and winning a full match awards <strong>+25 XP + Gold Coins</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 6. Merge Game -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🧩 Up to 250 XP/game</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Merge Game Arcade Cabinet</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Test your puzzle reflexes on the Darkmoon Edition Merge arcade cabinets. Earn <strong>1 XP for every 10 points scored</strong> (up to 250 XP per game) plus Gold Coins upon game completion (150 Coins/day cap).
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 7. Coin Hunts -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🪙 +1 to +50 Coins ✨</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Sim-Wide Coin Hunt</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Explore secret nooks, high rafters, dungeon cells, and rooftop gardens. Hidden gold coins, rare token chests, and mystery multipliers refresh every 3 hours across the estate.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 8. Tribute Jars -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🏺 Instant 1:1 XP Match</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Tribute Jars &amp; FinDom Gifting</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Every Linden Dollar (L$) paid into a registered Dominant's Tribute Jar instantly converts into matching XP for both the gifter and recipient, powering your leveling while honoring your Domme.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 9. DJ & Staff Tips -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🎧 +10 to +50 XP</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">DJ &amp; Staff Tip Jars</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Show love to live sim performers, DJs, hosts, and stage dancers during scheduled events. Tipping awards instant XP bonuses and triggers celebratory ambient light beams across the ballroom.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 10. Profile Picks -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">⭐ +100 XP / Week</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Profile 'Picks' Loyalty</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Add Control &amp; Chaos to your Second Life viewer profile Picks. Touch the Loyalty Board weekly to verify your profile link and collect <strong>+100 XP</strong> and <strong>+20 Gold Coins</strong> automatically.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 11. Referral Bounty -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">🤝 +50 XP per Citizen</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Citizen Referral Program</h3>
            <p class="earn-card-desc">
              Invite friends or submissives to register on the sim. Once your referral reaches Level 5 in either faction, both of you are awarded <strong>+50 XP</strong> and a 10 Gold Coin referral bounty.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 12. Cage Break Events -->
          <div class="earn-card">
            <span class="earn-payout-badge">⛓️ Weekly Event Prizes</span>
            <h3 class="earn-card-title">Cage Break Mini-Events</h3>
